BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dg8z1JnpT6hqYrRe1mPde
SUMMARY:Religious & Civic Leader Gathering: "The Future of Faith"
DTSTAMP:20260730T054954Z
DTSTART:20260914T223000Z
DESCRIPTION:Sociologist and co-founder of Future of Faith (https://www.futu
	reoffaith.org/)Josh Packard (https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp\;source=w
	eb&amp\;rct=j&amp\;opi=89978449&amp\;url=https://faithandleadership.com/au
	thors/josh-packard&amp\;ved=2ahUKEwihuajevNeVAxVPkGoFHawNNIMQFnoECB4QAQ&am
	p\;usg=AOvVaw3e1UHYZqtrGrGN7SSIchVn) will join the Boniuk Institute's Reli
	gion and Public Live Center for an in-person conversation with director To
	dd Ferguson on "The Future of Faith."  &#160\;About Religious &amp\; Civic
	 Leader Gatherings  Hosted by the Boniuk Institute's Religion and Public L
	ife Center (https://boniuk.rice.edu/RPLC)\, Religious &amp\; Civic Leader 
	Gatherings are a series of carefully curated events that connect local lea
	ders with current research relevant to the work they do in the their commu
	nities.&#160\; This group spans all faith traditions (an those of no faith
	 affiliation) and is designed to build a well-informed network of leaders 
	who make Houston a more vibrant city.&#160\;  &#160\;If you are a religiou
	s or community leader and would like to receive an invitation to these eve
	nts\, please email Hayley Hemstreet at hjh@rice.edu (mailto:hjh@rice.edu).
	\n\nhttps://events.rice.edu/event/435032-religious-civic-leader-gathering-
	the-future-of\n\nFrom Rice University - Open to the Public
URL:https://events.rice.edu/event/435032-religious-civic-leader-gathering-t
	he-future-of
GEO:29.7174;-95.4018
LOCATION:TBA
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:rice-public-events
CATEGORIES:Rice University - Open to the Public
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
